Spider Bakery was an [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Arachnid Arachnid] added in '''Beta 46.0. '''It's a 3/3/3 monster with the Magic of adding 2 [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Spider Spiders] to your deck. It also has a Synergy, which makes it add a Spider Croissant and Spider Donut instead. '''Beta 52.0''' gave it -1 ATK and its Magic and Synergy now adds one of the two new cards to your hand instead of your deck.

